===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|hundred}}, from {{inherited|en|ang|hundred}}, from {{inherited|en|gem-pro|*hundaradą}}, from {{m|gem-pro|*hundą}} (from {{der|en|ine-pro|*ḱm̥tóm}}) + {{m|gem-pro|*radą||count}}, a neuter variant of {{m|gem-pro|*radō||row, line, series}}.<ref name="Kroonen">{{R:gem:EDPG|head=*radō|page=401}}</ref> Compare {{cog|fy|hûndert}}, {{cog|nl|honderd}}, {{cog|nds|hunnert}}, {{m|nds|hunnerd}}, {{cog|de|Hundert}}, {{cog|da|hundred}}.

